    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50981" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vindēmĭo</span></b> ,
		āre, v. n.
		vindemia, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to gather grapes</i>, <i>gather the
				vintage</i> (post-Aug.); <i>absol.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jam et Calend. Jan. vindemiantes vidi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					18, 31, 74, § 319</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">35, 10, 37,
				§ 310</span></i>. —With a homogeneous object: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					12, 33, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">uvas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					14, 2, 4, § 30</span></i>
			.</div>
